a:["$","p","p-7",{"children":"从外部客户端看来，服务的端口从未关闭，请求始终被处理，一次完美的零停机更新就这样在进程层面完成了。"}]
b:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"2-新世界的哲学--kubernetes-的宏大编排","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#2-新世界的哲学--kubernetes-的宏大编排","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#2-新世界的哲学--kubernetes-的宏大编排"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 新世界的哲学 —— Kubernetes 的宏大编排","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":5,"offset":1973},"end":{"line":65,"column":34,"offset":2002}}}]},"children":"2. 新世界的哲学 —— Kubernetes 的宏大编排"}]}]
c:["$","p","p-8",{"children":["现在，让我们把视角切换到 Kubernetes。Kubernetes 的世界观与 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tableflip"}]," 的假设完全不同。它的核心哲学是",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"不可变基础设施 (Immutable Infrastructure)"}],"。"]}]
d:["$","p","p-9",{"children":["在这个哲学下，运行中的容器 (Pod) 被视为",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"短暂的、可任意替代的"}],"（ephemeral and disposable），就像牧群中的牛羊 (cattle)，而不是需要精心照料的宠物 (pets)。我们从不\"修复\"或\"升级\"一个正在运行的容器，我们只用一个新的、配置好的容器去",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"替换"}],"它。"]}]
e:["$","p","p-10",{"children":["Kubernetes 实现零停机更新的机制，是",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"滚动替换 (Rolling Update)"}],"，这是一场由更高维度（",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Deployment"}]," 控制器）编排的、跨越整个集群的宏大工程。"]}]
f:["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"3-范式冲突--为什么-tableflip-水土不服","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#3-范式冲突--为什么-tableflip-水土不服","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#3-范式冲突--为什么-tableflip-水土不服"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 范式冲突 —— 为什么 ","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":5,"offset":2362},"end":{"line":73,"column":20,"offset":2377}}},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"tableflip","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":20,"offset":2377},"end":{"line":73,"column":31,"offset":2388}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":20,"offset":2377},"end":{"line":73,"column":31,"offset":2388}}},{"type":"text","value":" 水土不服","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":31,"offset":2388},"end":{"line":73,"column":36,"offset":2393}}}]},"children":["3. 范式冲突 —— 为什么 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tableflip"}]," 水土不服"]}]}]
10:["$","p","p-11",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tableflip"}]," 的优雅，建立在一个稳定的、可直接操控进程的底层环境之上。而 Kubernetes 恰恰抽象掉了这个底层，带来了更高维度的管理模型。二者的冲突，源于根本性的“世界观”不合。"]}]
11:["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"抽象层级不匹配"}],": ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tableflip"}]," 在",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Pod 内部"}]," 玩\"进程接力\"，而 Kubernetes 在",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"Pod 外部"}]," 玩\"Pod 替换\"。你在旧 Pod 内部做的任何进程替换，对于 Kubernetes 的宏大更新流程来说，是毫无意义的。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"资源竞争与 OOMKilled"}],": ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tableflip"}]," 在执行 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Upgrade()"}]," 的短暂瞬间，父子两个进程会同时存在，这意味着应用的内存和 CPU 消耗可能会瞬间翻倍。在资源受严格限制的 Kubernetes Pod 中，这极易触发 OOMKilled（Out of Memory Killer），优雅重启变成了\"暴力猝死\"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"功能冗余与复杂化"}],": Kubernetes 的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Deployment"}]," + ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Service"}]," + ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Readiness Probe"}]," 已经提供了一套经过大规模生产验证的、跨节点的零停机更新方案。",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"tableflip"}]," 想要解决的问题，在 Kubernetes 的世界里已经由更高维度的架构设计解决了。"]}],"\n"]}]
12:["$","h3","h3-4",{"id":"4-k8s-的优雅之道--go-开发者深度实践指南","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#4-k8s-的优雅之道--go-开发者深度实践指南","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#4-k8s-的优雅之道--go-开发者深度实践指南"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. K8s 的优雅之道 —— Go 开发者深度实践指南","position":{"start":{"line":81,"column":5,"offset":2967},"end":{"line":81,"column":33,"offset":2995}}}]},"children":"4. K8s 的优雅之道 —— Go 开发者深度实践指南"}]}]
13:["$","p","p-12",{"children":"既然旧世界的魔法已经失效，我们就必须学习并掌握新世界的规则。在 Kubernetes 中，真正的优雅，是应用程序与编排平台之间的一场精妙的“双人舞”。"}]
